From 0744ec1a26854fe1d0085171c9994b593fbff2db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:00:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): Stock From model applies the part that Source
 shows

The Source picker wrote the part name into the stock draft only when the
selection index changed. With one model the index cannot change, so Apply
submitted an empty source and stock creation failed. The picker now writes
the shown part into the draft whenever the two differ.

Pinned by from_model_apply_takes_the_only_part_shown and
from_model_apply_takes_the_part_shown_of_several.

Fixes #3261

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
